@startuml
mode compact
time-axis unit "µs"
analog "+3V3 [+3V3]" between 0.0 and 3.6 as r3v3 <<analog>> <<net>>
binary "PG_3V3 [PG_3V3]" as pg3v3 <<binary>> <<net>>
analog "+1V8 [+1V8]" between 0.0 and 2.0 as r1v8 <<analog>> <<net>>
binary "nRESET [NRESET]" as nreset <<binary>> <<net>>
robust "MCU [MCU boot]" as mcu <<robust>> <<machine>>
clock "SysTick" as sysTick with period 1000 pulse 500 offset 7000 <<clock>>
mcu has "Off" as Off
mcu has "Reset" as Reset
mcu has "ROM boot" as ROM_boot
mcu has "App init" as App_init
mcu has "Running" as Running
mcu has "Fault" as Fault
@0
r3v3 is 0
pg3v3 is low
r1v8 is 0
nreset is low
mcu is Off
@200
r3v3 is 0
@1200
r3v3 is 3.3
@1400
pg3v3 is high
@1500
r1v8 is 0
@2000
r1v8 is 1.8
mcu is Reset
@5200
nreset is high
mcu is ROM_boot
@5600
mcu is App_init
@7000
mcu is Running
@10000
r3v3@1200 <-> @1500 : ≥ 100 µs
r1v8@1500 <-> @2000 : 300 µs – 1 ms
nreset@1200 <-> @5200 : 2 ms – 5 ms
mcu@5200 <-> @7000 : ≤ 2 ms
pg3v3@1400 -> r1v8@1500 : EN
nreset@5200 -> mcu@5200 : resetRelease
highlight 2000 to 5200 : reset held
@enduml
